\par
$\tab\tab\par
\par
\tab\tab The $ file is located in blocks 0040-0057 on every logical \tab\tab\tab device unit.  Most of the considerations of the % file apply \tab\tab with the exception of certain command settings and default \tab\tab\tab file options in certain programs where one of the two files \tab\tab is used instead of the other.\par
