Edit Buffer\par
\par
\tab\tab The edit buffer is a 2048 word memory area internal to the \tab\tab\tab keyboard monitor and integrated editor.  It is used to \tab\tab\tab temporarily hold a TFS text file during all editing \tab\tab\tab\tab operations.  File updates are made permanent by writing the \tab\tab contents of the edit buffer to a named file.  If keyboard \tab\tab\tab monitor commands are strictly limited to loading and saving \tab\tab the edit buffer, TFS files of any format can be copied using \tab\tab the edit buffer as intermediary storage.\par
