\tab\tab\tab P?S/8 includes support for a variety of system console \tab\tab\tab device variants such as the VT-100 [and compatible] \tab\tab\tab\tab family of display terminals as well as older models \tab\tab\tab\tab such as the VT-52 and the VT05.  [Note: The VT05 \tab\tab\tab\tab\tab requires the use of the M8655 KL8-JA serial interface \tab\tab\tab\tab card with the fill-jumper set unless used at 300 baud \tab\tab\tab\tab or less.]\par
